  "icon": "🏪",
  "description": "Twist \"N\" Reels is a comfortable 2020, 27 foot, Tidewater center console deep v boat equipped with all the newest technology and safety features for your comfort to enjoy your boat charters. Don't fight crowds on overbooked Fishing Charters or dolphin tours or booze cruises. Reserve the Boat Charter experience of your lifetime. Come out to the blue waters of the great Pensacola, Perdido Key and Orange Beach area, give us a call and let us take you on your own Salty Adventure. We have a variety of Boat Charters for you to choose from. We offer nearshore/offshore Fishing Charters, inshore fishing trips, dolphin tours, sunset cruises, beach bar booze cruise tours, and swim and play trips. We serve the Pensacola, Perdido Key, Orange Beach areas and would love to be a part of your dream vacation. Our Pensacola based Boat Charters are developed for family fun in the sun, laid back fishing trips, booze cruise, and Fishing Charters for those hard corps fisherman. We work hard to satisfy your vacation needs. If you don't see a charter you desire, give us a call, we will do everything to design your salty adventure.",
